            },
            {
              "char_end": 154,
              "char_start": 0,
              "content": "Transaction record TX-1 reports a transfer of USD 500 from ACC-100 to ACC-200 at 2026-01-10 09:00 UTC. The record names Alice Chen as the initiating user.",
